window.products.push({"id":175024,"name":"H.VERSAILTEX 4 Piece Stretch Sofa Covers for 3 Cushion Couch Covers for Living Room Furniture Slipcovers (Base Cover Plus 3 Seat Cushion Covers) Upgra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EhUSqW4aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"85% Polyester/15% Spandex Imported Jacquard Knitted Fabric CUSTOM FIT: Our newest modern stretch sofa slipcovers are constructed with 4 PIECE style (including 1 base cover and 3 individual cushion covers), separate seat cushions require no re-tucking. Allows you to create the custom upholstered look you have been waiting for in vibrant checked pattern jacquard. Featuring a secure and exacting fit with smart seam and elastic edging all around UPGRADED THICKER: Smart slipcovers are crafted from thicken soft jacquard fabric with high quality stretch, our form fit covers have a snugger fit thanks to stretchable fabrics, Best fits sofas 72 to 88-inches wide (outside arm to outside arm, straight across), 36 to 40-inches tall. Each individual cushion cover fits up to 19.6-29 inch width, 21.6-30.5 inch depth, 2-10 inch thickness FULL PROTECT: Save your high-quality furniture pieces without requiring pricey reupholstery. Couch covers can restore it beautifully and inexpensively. It will protect your sofa from more damage. Our durable couch slipcovers are meticulously constructed to withstand tears made by your car keys, coffee stains, and even overenergetic (and destructive) kids and pets INNOVATE STYLE: Our neutral sofa slipcovers showcase bright colors for a bold look, turn all eyes to the splash of color that will enliven any space with a youthful glow. Perfect to fit your one-of-a-kind, personal style, change your couch cover to set a new mood for holidays, special occasions, or because you just feel like it, also it is environmentally friendly—you’ll won’t be creating more waste to buy a new sofa EASY CARE: Just toss the slipcover in the washing machine for effortless upkeep. Wrinkle free. Separately in cold water on the gentle cycle, do not use bleach. For drying, tumble dry low and remove them promptly from dryer. Shopping more sofa slipcovers / protectors in H.VERSAILTEX brand to dress your furniture","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EhUSqW4aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H.VERSAILTEX","source_asin":"B094QTCMWV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094QTCMWV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094QTCMWV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":175025,"name":"SnapeZo Silver Poster Frame A1 Size, 1.2 Inch Aluminum Profile, Front-Loading Snap Frame, Wall Mounting, Premium Series","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YhHhC1AjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Display and protect your posters using our unique and trademark design SnapeZo frames! A fast and easy solution to your sign and display requirements. Suitable for public areas such as restaurants, community centers and movie theater, or at home to showcase your favorite poster or artwork just like the professionals do. Made with durability in mind, this Solid Aluminum frame is made to the highest industry standards, the best value available poster frame. It features a super white transluscent backing that offers some water resistance and gives the graphics 'pop'. Strong, yet lightweight and easy to use. The front snaps open on spring hinges to change posters - no tools and removal from wall required. Flexible PET lens offers non-glare and UV protection. Comes with all the necessary hardware and concealed mounting holes. This frame can be hung both vertically and horizontally. This is the industry standard - we supply the world's leading brands - Disney, NASA, Walgreens, ABC, etc. Buy with confidence from industry's best: SnapeZo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YhHhC1AjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SnapeZo","source_asin":"B076B1VCGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076B1VCGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076B1VCGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":175026,"name":"Bulova Fantastic Strike & Chime Wall Clock, Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":243.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TT46+abrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspired by old-world clockmaking artistry, this beauty dazzles the eye and delights the ear. As tunes play, the dial opens, on the hour, to reveal an inner design and lights that flash in time to the song. A selection of 18 total different tunes, grouped by (A) Zen Melodies, (B) Holiday Classics or (C) World Favorites, chose which set to play progressively on the hour. The handsome gold-tone-finish molded case has burl woodgrain accents and painterly-like details on dial and inner case, a rotating pendulum with super clear K-9 crystal elements that reflect and sparkle in the light. There’s also an adjustable volume control, automatic night shutoff and an on-demand control button that allows you to hear the songs anytime. Protective glass lens. Quartz movement. Requires (4) D batteries, not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TT46+abrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bulova","source_asin":"B08B6DNSXJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B6DNSXJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B6DNSXJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
