window.products.push({"id":175141,"name":"BioChef Vacuum Blending Accessory suitable for BioChef Living Food Blender + Vacuum bag adaptor with 3 reusable vacuum seal bags … (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bx1wD2o+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The high speeds of modern blenders expose your produce to oxidation which can destroy the nutrients in your food.The BioChef Vacuum Blending Accessory will help to preserve the flavours and nutrients in your produce in a few simple steps. Using the BioChef Vacuum Blending Accessory to remove the air from the blender jug allows your produce to blend in a low-oxygen environment, eliminating the oxidation process. Allowing your produce to blend in a low-oxygen environment can extend the shelf life of your smoothie, keeping the fresh flavour, texture and colour of a freshly blended smoothie! Features of the BioChef Vacuum Blending Accessory: Compatible with the BioChef Living Food Blender and all Bianco High Performance Blenders Compatible with the BioChef Living Food Blender and all Bianco High Performance Blenders Preserve your food with 3 reusable vacuum sealable bags Preserve your food with 3 reusable vacuum sealable bags Minimises oxidation of food inside the blender Minimises oxidation of food inside the blender Easy to use with automatic-stop function Easy to use with automatic-stop function 2 Year Warranty 2 Year Warranty What's Included: Adaptor plug for blender Adaptor plug for blender Adaptor for food bags Adaptor for food bags Silicone seal Silicone seal 3 x reusable vacuum bags (8.66 inches x 13.38 inches) 3 x reusable vacuum bags (8.66 inches x 13.38 inches)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bx1wD2o+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bio Chef","source_asin":"B07DR1KNLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DR1KNLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DR1KNLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":175142,"name":"1000 Thread Count Oversized King Duvet Cover 120X98 100% Egyptian Cotton Breathable All Season with Zipper Closure & Corner Ties Soft Comforter Cover ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fRDZF-uLS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SIZE INFORMATION: 1 Oversized King Duvet Cover (120\"X98\") PURE EGYPTIAN COTTON BEDDING: Kotton Culture's Premium Cotton Bedding is naturally soft and breathable. Our thick Duvet Cover is designed using a tighter fabric weave to give it extra softness and durability. Get rid of dust-trapping microfiber and bring home the luxurious hotel experience with cotton fiber with a smooth sateen finish. ZIPPER CLOSURE & CORNER TIES: Each cotton duvet cover features a hidden, hassle-free zipper closure, easier than regular button closure, so you can conveniently get your comforter in and out of this cover. The quilt cover also has 7 internal ties to prevent slippage, keeping your insert in place. ELEGANT DESIGN IN 1000 TC: Our Duvet Covers are available in a wide range of vibrant colors. The craftsmanship of 1000 threads per inch provides a blend of softness, durability, and year-round comfort—use the cooling duvet covers in the summer or layer in the winter. EASY CARE: This classic blanket cover is finished with high-strength stitching and is low-maintenance. Machine wash in cold water, tumble dry low, and iron when needed. If you prefer wrinkle-free bedding, use a short dry cycle and take your cover out promptly from the dryer. BUY ETHICALLY MADE PRODUCTS: Make a better choice for the planet with a high-quality, earth-friendly pinch pleat comforter set, crafted in a socially responsible manner and individually inspected. Get the luxury of tencel and the cheap pricing of microfibre with Kotton Culture’s Egyptian Cotton bedding basics store that offers pintucked bedspreads, bedsheets, kitchen linen, curtain, fluffy waffle blankets, and heavyweight down alternative comforters in striped, solid, and printed collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fRDZF-uLS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kotton Culture","source_asin":"B0C23CZ7WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C23CZ7WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C23CZ7WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":175143,"name":"ENVION Therapure TPP630 Medium to Large Room Filter HEPA Air Purifier with 3 Fan Speeds, 4 Step Purification, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tjgxlwJkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With more and more air irritants affecting day-to-day life, make sure your own home isn't subject to the same conditions. With the Therapure HEPA Air Purifier from ENVION, your space will be free from air pollutants that can be dangerous for your health. Made for medium to large rooms, this air cleaner can purify up to 300 square feet 3.5 times in 1 hour. The 3-speed fan lets you decide what cleaning level is most desirable. With True HEPA filtration, this air purifier captures 99.9-percent of pollutants. With an easy-to-clean filter, you can limit the frequency of costly filter replacements, saving money. The built-in handle makes the purifier easy to transport, and you can control the whole machine with analog controls. Say goodbye to irritants, cigarette smoke, odors, and pet hair in your home. Don't overlook the impact your home's air quality has on your well-being. Improve your health and the health of those around you with the ENVION Therapure HEPA Air Purifier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tjgxlwJkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Envion","source_asin":"B0846CJGN4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0846CJGN4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0846CJGN4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
