window.products.push({"id":175245,"name":"WiFi Range Extender Repeater, Latest 5GHz & 2.4GHz Dual Band 1200Mbps WiFi Repeater Wireless Signal Booster, 360 Degree Full Coverage WiFi Extender Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Al3c14M8L._AC_.jpg","description":"【Item Feature】 1, Easy wireless security encryption at a push of the WPS button. 2, LEDs indicator- Sharing the working conditions of device at any time. 3, Function selection button- Multi-function operating selection, bring you the special networking situation. 4, RJ-45 Ethernet ports- Sharing 2x 10/100Mbps Ethernet LAN/WAN ports, providing a multiple-choice for you. 5, Simultaneously it supports 2.4G and 5G wireless network connection, transmission speeds of up to 1200Mbps. 6, The isolated heat dissipation design can effectively prevent the intrusion of dust and quickly dissipate heat, ensuring stable operation of the equipment all the time. 7, Fully compatible with any devices like iOS, Android devices, Echo/Alexa devices, PCs, PlayStation, smart plugs and so on. 【Multiple Functions】 WiFi Range Extender(Repeater)- Extend WiFi coverage of an existing wireless network. Wireless Access Point- Convert a wired network to a wireless network. Wireless Router- Create an instant private wireless AC1200 network. 【System Requirement】 100 ~ 240-volt socket The WLAN client must support at least the WPA encryption standard WLAN access point and the WLAN client with automatic IP address assignment (DHCP) Forwarding of IPv4-based protocols/Address Resolution Protocol The network name (SSID) of the WLAN access point must be set to \"visible\" 【Warm Tips】 1, The wifi extender mode of this device can be set up by wireless device such as smart phone or laptop. 2, Setup Repeater mode successfully beside router, and then move repeater to another place, thus lessening issues. 【Package Included】 1 x Wireless WIFI Range Extender Repeater 1 x RJ-45 Ethernet Cable 1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Al3c14M8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GALAWAY-US","source_asin":"B00QFY82ZU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QFY82ZU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QFY82ZU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
