window.products.push({"id":175286,"name":"Bundle of 3 items: Rada Pizza Stone (6001), Wooden Pizza Peel and Pizza Dough Recipe Booklet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pggKiKLGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Bundle of 3 items: Rada Pizza Stone (6001), Wooden Pizza Peel and Pizza Recipe Booklet This bundle makes the perfect gift for a Pizza Chef and is packaged ready for gift wrapping in a white pizza box. The Rada Cutlery Stoneware Pizza Baking Stone absorbs heat to maintain an even baking temperature. The textured surface produces pizzeria-type crusts for superior results. Rada stoneware can go directly from the freezer to a pre-heated 400 degree oven without cracking the stoneware. No pre-use seasoning is required: before using your stone for the first time, simply rinse it in warm water and towel dry. There is no need to season and re-season before every use, Rada stoneware is naturally stick resistant. A light spritz of cooking spray will enhance the release properties for use with egg dishes or wet batters. Rada stoneware is dishwasher safe! Unlike most other brands of stoneware, Rada stoneware can be washed in the dishwasher. Rada stoneware has a 3 year manufacturer warranty against defects in material, construction or workmanship. (The warranty does not apply to damage resulting from misuse, abuse or accidents.) Stone measures 15 inches in diameter. This wood pizza peel features a 12\" x 14\" blade with an 8\" handle for a total overall length of 22\". It's made of 1/2\" rubberwood with a tapered design for ease of use. A smooth, contoured handle makes this peel a pleasure to use. This pizza peel can be seasoned or sealed with oil, to avoid burns or scorch marks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pggKiKLGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RADA","source_asin":"B00DVPTOW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DVPTOW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DVPTOW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":175287,"name":"Pour Over Kettle - Jake & Leo - Premium Stylish Modern Design, Stainless Steel - Gooseneck Specialty Kettle for Kitchen Stovetop - 34oz, Matte Black, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lnOs9Nk3L._AC_SL1225_.jpg","description":"Looking for a Pour Over Kettle unlike any other? Have you also been thinking that specialty coffee and tea has been getting less special? Has your once cool, hipster pot become a bit more run-of-the-mill? We have been hearing the same, and we decided to do something about it. The Jake & Leo 'Dimple' Pour Over Kettle is bringing back cutting edge style and design for cool, stylish, hip coffee and tea lovers. Catch Eyes with the Dimpled-Diamonds Our dimpled-diamond pattern catches the eye and draws in your gaze. You’ll enjoy watching this pot boil!! It’s a waffle effect on the premium stainless steel, which adds elegance both on the exterior and interior of our gooseneck tea and coffee kettle. Take Time for Great Coffee and Tea Your life is busy… from the moment you wake up to the moment you go to bed – running after the kids, juggling your work priorities, sorting things out at home. We know! So why not cherish some ‘you time’? :D The ‘Jake & Leo’ Kettle is your perfect companion. Enjoy the style and design as your water heats, then slowly pour from the precision spout. Watch the water ease from the spout and therapeutically swirl into your server or cup. Breathe in the first smell of your freshly brewed coffee or tea, close your eyes and relax. Statement Style for Your Stovetop Stovetops of the nation have been calling out for some style. Don't they deserve more than one of those regular basic pour-over kettles? It’s time to show off your kitchen – the ‘Jake & Leo’ pot will give an accent touch to your stovetop and give an air of quality and finesse to your kitchen décor. So why wait? Style Your Home-Brewing :) Get your own ‘Jake & Leo’ Kettle now! Product Details Pour Over Kettle Material: 304 Stainless Steel Color: Matte Black Length 12.6” Height 5.9” Holds 34 fl oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lnOs9Nk3L._AC_SL1225_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jake & Leo","source_asin":"B07HCHGLSB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HCHGLSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HCHGLSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
