window.products.push({"id":175290,"name":"Rosnek Stretch Couch Cushion Covers for Sectional Sofa L Shape,Velvet Sectional Sofa Cover Soft Slipcover for L Shaped Sofa(for 3 Cushions or Chaise L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71utKVlooqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤Please Note:1 Piece for 2/3/4 cushions means only a rectangle cushion cover that long enough for 2/3/4 individual cushions.If you want a sectional cushion cover for chaise lounge.You can measure chaise lounge first and see whether the buying option \"1 Piece for 3/4 Cushions or Chaise Longue\"fits or not.If you still not sure about the accurate size.You can buy the larger one(\"1 Piece for 4 Cushions or Chaise Longue\") .Extra fabric can be tucked.For more details please check the details page. ❤Comfortable and perfect sofa experience:premium fabric .Endurable and free wrinkle,95% polyester, 5% spandex fabric. Thick and highly-elastic velvet plush fabric, ultra soft, skin-friendly, Stretchy&durable, ensure the long-term use.The physical display of the sofa cover can be seen in the video.Velvet couch covers in pure color design. Simple but tasteful. An easy-matcher to your home decor! Little money for a brand new cushion! ❤Why choose Rosnek’s cushion couch cover?Elastic band at the bottom. Prevent your cushion from spills, stains, pet scratches and daily wear. Ensure the seat slipcover to firmly stay in place. High quality! If the sofa cover is damaged within two years, please attach a photo of the damage and let us know, Rosnek will replace it for free.you don't need to worry about anything when purchase at Rosnek ! ❤EASY CARE and GREAT FIT：machine washable in cold water, Separate wash. Gentle cycle. Do not bleach or iron. Easy for maintenance.GREAT FIT: This sofa couch cover is crafted from polar fleece. Feature one-size-fits-most, kindly measure before ordering. High recommended for both leather and cloth sofa ❤Rosnek COMMITMENT: Fast delivery，30-day unconditional returns and 24 months replacement, 100% satisfied service, all issues will be solved within 24 hours. If you care about your shopping quality, Rosnek is your best choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71utKVlooqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosnek","source_asin":"B0B4JBWX75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4JBWX75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4JBWX75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":175291,"name":"Unconditional ROSIE Wedding Gift for Couple, Memory Book | A Hardcover Journal to Document Anniversaries from The 1st to The 50th Year | Present for H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ShLWtfKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful keepsake album allows you to record a lifetime of memories with your spouse. Easily record the details of each anniversary celebration and special moments throughout the years of your marriage! Perfect wedding anniversary gifts for couple Document every special and sentimental anniversary from your wedding day (first day) through your 50th anniversary: 1st, 2nd, 3rd, 4th, 5th, 10th, 15th, 20th, 25th, 30th, 35th, 40th, 45th, 50th, -- this album provides a space for photographs and a record page for your special memories. You can also document every date night or happy story that you had together. This journal has dozens of beautifully illustrated pages, measures 8X8 inches and includes three sheets of high-quality stickers so that you can customize your pages in a unique way. It is hardcover and printed on thick high-quality paper which makes it portable and sturdy at the same time. It is the best gift if you're in a relationship. Amazing for married couples. This anniversary book is a yearly record keeper that includes a helpful list of flowers and traditional and modern gifts for each of the anniversaries. First anniversary gifts for her, the best way to surprise your loved one. Tin gifts for 10th anniversary Love it or your money back! We are so confident that you will love your Unconditional Rosie Wedding Anniversary Journal that we offer a lifetime guarantee. If at any point you decide you are not completely satisfied we will refund 100% of your purchase. No questions asked. We hope you have an AMAZING experience filling out this book. Hugs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ShLWtfKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unconditional ROSIE","source_asin":"B0B14BC6XQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B14BC6XQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B14BC6XQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
