window.products.push({"id":175317,"name":"Molten Glass On Teak Driftwood Decorative Bowl Vase Terrarium Planter Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AOUr7S0xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Truly versatile, these delightful sculptural vases are simple yet elegant accent pieces full of earthy allure. Their organic intrigue brings visual excitement just for their looks alone, and you can fill them with anything you choose. The teak driftwood provides a beautiful base to the glass as it sinks in and forms the natural contours of the wood. Plant a succulent garden, grow fresh herbs for cooking, create a fairy garden, or arrange colorful stones, shells, or dried flowers; the options are only as limited as your creativity. Organic intrigue and earthy allure artistically meld in this set of glass and wood sculptures that are inspired by nature and perfected by artisans. NOTE: Due to the nature of the materials, no two are exactly alike. Measures 6.5 inches long, 6.5 inches high, and 5 inches wide, size is approximate and will vary slightly by piece.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AOUr7S0xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zeckos","source_asin":"B07CKNSJQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CKNSJQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CKNSJQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
