window.products.push({"id":175353,"name":"Bliwans Cellular Shades, Blackout Blinds, Cordless Honeycomb Blinds for Windows, Room Darkening, Pleated Window Shades for Bedroom, Home, Bathroom, Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714NAkwGMHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌜【Double Color Shades】The grey blackout cellular blinds have two colors on each side, both side can be installed. Since one of our cellular shades could express two different styles, it can be used as a stylish decoration for your home. Two colors are great window treatment for office, living room, bedroom, kitchen, nursery or any room. 🌜【Safety Cordless Design】Cordless cellular shades are safety for children and pets. Our cordless cellular blinds are safer because of the cord-free design, which could provide a clean, fresh look to the window and creates a safer environment for children and pets. With the touch of a finger, you can easily lift up and pull down the shades with the handle. 🌜【100% Blackout & Room Darkening】Opaque lining provides the ultimate in room darkening and privacy control. Blackout cellular shades can achieve 100% shading effect and provide perfect privacy. Our blackout blinds block out harsh sunlight and reduce harmful effects of UV rays. 🌜【Honeycomb Structure】Cellular shades, also known as honeycomb shades, are made up of different compartments. Honeycomb blinds were inspired by bees and the honeycomb structure acts as insulation to keep your room warmer in winter and cooler in summer. Honeycomb design and the built-in aluminum foil reflects UV rays and heat in the summer and keeps out cold air in the winter. 🌜【Easy to Install & Clean】The honeycomb shades can be mounted inside or outside. All necessary accessories are included in the package, and the mounting instructions are provided for quick and easy mounting. The honeycomb structure is easy to clean, use a small cloth, a feather duster or a hand vacuum cleaner with a soft brush. All blinds have a little deduction. Inside Mounting cell blind black out for windows require a minimum 2\" window frame depth, blackout shades width need to be 1/4\" less than window width. 🌜【Heat & Sound Absorption】Energy efficient cellular construction helps maintain indoor room temperatures. Honeycomb design and the built-in aluminum foil reflects UV rays and heat in the summer and keeps out cold air in the winter. Blackout blinds absorb sound energy, creating a more quiet, tranquil room, just pull down the shades to darken the room, very suitable for nap and bedtime. 💡【Shipping and Service】Amazon are takes charge of the all FBA Orders shipment. 💌 If you have any questions about the size of the blinds & shades, please feel free to contact Bliwans before purchasing. ❤ Please don't hesitate to seek help if you have any problems on products, each product come with a warranty & online assistance for all the customers, and we will reply and deal with it within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714NAkwGMHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bliwans","source_asin":"B0BHSR2B7Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHSR2B7Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHSR2B7Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
