window.products.push({"id":175384,"name":"Pidada Hand Towels Set of 2 Indian Geometric Pattern 100% Cotton Soft Decorative Towel for Bathroom 13.4 x 29.5 Inch (Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TflV-6yBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Size】Pack of 2; 13.4 x 29.5 inch; Not standard size. 【Material】100% Cotton, Free of Harmful Chemicals. 【Quality】Soft; Absorbent; Quick Dry; yet light-weighted. Gives the body a soft and delicate touch while absorbing the moisture. 【Machine Washable】Towels are Easy to Care and Clean. 【Multi-Purpose】Pidada hand towels are useful and decorative in various places such as; bathroom, bath, kitchen,spa and fitness. It can also be used as gift, guest, face, hair, dishcloth, gym, yoga and travel towel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TflV-6yBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pidada","source_asin":"B07S218D15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S218D15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S218D15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":175385,"name":"Hot Shot Bedbug Mattress And Luggage Treatment Kit, Seals Mattresses And Other Household Items For Treatment Clear Pack of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":91.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812GRk3U6pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Between the carpool and the couch cushions, you’re the CEO of the home front. Take care of your family – and take care of business, no matter where household pests rear their ugly heads. Show bugs who’s boss with Hot Shot insecticides. They’re your weapon of choice, giving you the clear advantage within your walls and at the bank. Save the day.Hot Shot Bedbug Mattress & Luggage Treatment Kit is designed for the treatment of bed bugs and bed bug eggs on mattresses, box springs and non-washable items, including luggage, furniture and other similar household items. The treatment kit includes both a bed bug pest strip and a sealable treatment bag to combat bed bug infestations. The large bag holds and treats up to a king size mattress. The treatment bag can also be used to seal and dispose of infested items.Seal infested household items in the bag for up to 7 days to kill the bed bug eggs. Do not overfill the bag. When treatment is complete, remove treated items from the bag and let treated items air out in a well-ventilated area for no less than 4 hours. The treatment bag is intended for one-time use. Dispose of bag and used bed bug pest strip immediately in a manner that prevents reuse.Treating bed bugs as part of a cycle is key to gaining control. For best results, use this product as part of a comprehensive bed bug treatment plan. When creepy bugs attempt to pass, save the day with Hot Shot insecticides.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812GRk3U6pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOT SHOT","source_asin":"B0BRXJJ2JV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRXJJ2JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRXJJ2JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
