window.products.push({"id":175440,"name":"2 Foam Insulated 20oz Wide Body Thermoserv Mugs Blue Green Thermo Serv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qMKrGsFPL._AC_.jpg","description":"For over 30 years the foam insulated mug has been a staple of gas stations and convenience stores. Recently the old reliable foam insulated mug has disappeared and they have been replaced by trendy stylish mugs. Trendy and stylish is fine for clothes but not for a mug if it means a cold cup of coffee an hour into your driving trip. The main reason these mugs are no longer found is not the look but because the product was lost in the earlier 2000s in a series of mergers and acquisitions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qMKrGsFPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ThermoServ","source_asin":"B01I4XYC12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I4XYC12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I4XYC12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
