window.products.push({"id":175445,"name":"Porcelain Butter Dish with Knife & Wooden Lid, Henten Home Airtight Butter Keeper for Countertop, Large Butter Holder for East West Coast Butter(Matte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kQKulKvDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Perfectly Suitable for Most Butter】---The internal dimensions of our butter container are 6.3x3.55x2.55 inches, which can be used for most butter brands. Whether it is east, west coast butter or European butter, this large enough butter dish can be perfectly served. 【Healthy Ceramic Glaze】---The covered butter dish uses food-grade transparent ceramic glaze, which is non-toxic and harmless, and does not contain BAP, cadmium, and lead ions. 【Not Just a Butter Dish】---The sealing feature of the product allows you not only to put butter, but also to put your biscuits, cheese, desserts, fruits and other things. 【Stainless Steel Butter Knife】---The exquisite stainless steel butter knife fits the lid perfectly and feels right. You don't have to waste time looking for butter knives every morning, and cleaning is very simple. 【Safe Packaging】---The safety packaging design ensures that the product is not damaged. In addition, we provide 100% satisfactory after-sales service, you don't need to take any risk.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kQKulKvDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Henten Home","source_asin":"B09X1F5HHL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X1F5HHL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X1F5HHL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":175446,"name":"The Inside Scoop Bread and Bagel Scooper with an Ergonomic Grip","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rj5N6l5bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Inside Scoop is the perfect tool for bagel sandwiches, cream cheese and lox, and fresh bread. Make room for the good stuff by easily scooping out the excess carbs and putting in the filling. The Inside Scoop comes with a plastic protective cover for safe storage and is dishwasher safe for easy clean-up Jane*, an Accountant, and Avi, a Spine Surgeon, had just about as good of a relationship as sibling in-laws could have. Frequent vacations, daily FaceTime, etc... So, we decided to put that relationship to the test. How better to do that than combining forces on the creation of a revolutionary housewares product? After 8 months of consumer research and countless iterations, we accomplished our goal: Introducing The Inside Scoop. Though our relationship remains intact, we cannot say the same about the interior breading of bagels. *This is not Jane’s first foray into the kitchen gadget world. She, with another family member, invented the Guac-Lock – a container that prevents guacamole from turning brown.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rj5N6l5bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Inside Scoop","source_asin":"B08JD1L4DY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JD1L4DY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JD1L4DY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
