window.products.push({"id":175450,"name":"SWHOME 3-IN-1 Portable Evaporative Coolers 30\" Swamp Cooler Air Conditioner Fan Humidifier 12H Timer, with Remote Control Ice Box (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zdggn4omS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2 Blue Ice Boxes / 3-IN-1 Fan & Humidification & Air Cooler】This evaporative air cooler is equipped with 2 ice boxes, you can put the 2 ice boxes in the water tank of the evaporative air cooler to enhance cooling performance, 7L large-capacity water tank prevents you from adding water continuously, very convenient and comfortable 【3 Quiet Speeds & 3 Modes】The portable air conditioner comes with 3 levels of wind speeds ( High, Middle, Low) and 3 models (Normal, Nature, Sleep), it provides customizable cool airflow to meet your requirement in different time of this summer for your family 【12H Timer & Low Noise】The evaporative air cooler fan is built-in timer from 1 to 12hours, the fans can be turned off at the time you set it when you fall asleep or forget to turn it off, operates at low noise (less than 40dB), and will not disturb your life, working and sleep 【Bladeless & Grid Safe Design】The stylish safety grid design makes the swamp cooler cast a soft cold air for your family at hot summer, what is more, the grid and bladeless design also very safe for kids and pets; All packages include a detailed user manual, very easy to operate the portable air conditioner 【Smart Remote Controller & 4 Casters】The air cooler is equipped with a smart remote controller, you can use the wireless remote control to operate the air coolers from up to 19-inch' distance; the 4 swivel 360° casters makes the air cooler very easy to move, you can use it in your patio, yard, living room, car garage","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zdggn4omS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SWHOME","source_asin":"B093L2G4LZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093L2G4LZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093L2G4LZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
