window.products.push({"id":175619,"name":"King Mulberry Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin, 100% Real Pllow Cases, Covers Soft Smooth Pure with Hidden Zipper (Pink, 20''×36'', 1pc)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tu72jYDbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY SILK MATERIAL: Both sides premium grade 6A silk pillowcase is a hearty gift, which is ultra soft ,smooth and breathable.The comfort and breathability of silk make you feel refreshed in the summer and warm in winter. What's more we also focused on exquisite craftmanship of the neat stitches to make sure it long-lasting. PREVENT NIGHTTIME WRINKLES: About 1/3 of our life will be in contact with pillowcases,so it's really impormant to choose a superior quality pillowcase. Our 100% Highest Grade 6A silk pillowcase has smooth and supple feel allows your face to retain its naturally plump appearance. Silk contains 18 amino acids to improve your skin, breathable and soft as the second skin. Silk helps maintain the moisture balance required by the skin, preventing breakouts and reducing sleep wrinkles. PRESERVE GORGEOUS HAIR: Did you know cotton pillowcases actually sap your hair of moisture, leaving it dry, brittle and tangled? However silk has lowest frictional coefficient to the human skin is only 7.4%, not easy to generate static electricity after friction. Silk pillowcases maintain the natural oils in your hair to REDUCES BED HEAD, friction, and snag related SPLIT ENDS, so you wake up with hair that looks lush, flowing and tangle free. SEAMLESS LOOK, STRONG STITCHING: 100% real mulberry silk pllow case contains a HIDDEN ZIPPER, with near-invisible, multi-reinforced stitching, so your pillow stays tucked safely inside, without worry of exposure to dirt, dust, or other irritants. SILK CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Most recommended hand washing and dry clean. We suggest to use a mesh wash bag on delicate cycle when machine wash. Dry it in the shade to avoid wrinkles. Any quality issues, please feel free to contact us. We will give you a custom-made service at first time.Your satisfaction is our top priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tu72jYDbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyde Lane","source_asin":"B07WG9L52Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WG9L52Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WG9L52Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
