window.products.push({"id":175662,"name":"Mastectomy Pillow – Post Surgery Recovery Pillow after Breast Cancer, Breast Reduction, Caesarean Section Surgery- Chest Protector Belt Women – Breast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X4bDVy5PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CUSHION FOR POST-SURGERY RECOVERY: This breast cancer recovery pillow is suitable for mastectomy, lumpectomy, caesarean section or breast reconstruction. It is super soft and comfortable under the arms, while also supporting and protecting the chest. It contains a padded cushion and ultra-soft fabric, providing perfect support. FACILITATES SMOOTH HEALING: If you're recovering from surgery and need a reliable breast cushion, our mastectomy pillow is the one for you! Our post-surgery chest pillow ensures a smooth healing process by supporting your chest and a pouch for an ice pack to help reduce swelling. It is really beneficial to the overall healing process. PERFECT MASTECTOMY GIFT: This breast pillow for post-mastectomy has a unique design. It contains a plush stuffing that keeps you comfortable whether you're lying down, sitting or sleeping. Give it to a loved one who has recently undergone breast surgery to help them recover quickly. PAIN-FREE DRIVING: Whether you're driving or riding shotgun, you'll have the best protection against your seatbelt, so buckle up with confidence. Before you fully recover from surgery, our chest cushion can be your driving or riding friend 24 hours a day, seven days a week. LIGHTWEIGHT AND HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL: Since you are unable to lift big objects, we created our post-surgery pillows lightweight and easy to carry. During the recovery process, it's simple to move your double mastectomy pillow from the couch to your bed. It is made from soft, supportive and durable high quality materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X4bDVy5PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Assistex","source_asin":"B09KQH4HPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KQH4HPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KQH4HPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
