window.products.push({"id":175702,"name":"BIGLUFU Serving Tray Set of 2, Rustic Wooden Serving Tray with Metal Handles, Nesting Multipurpose Trays for Breakfast in Bed, Serving Platters Perfec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sdAkoMq8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌟[High-Quality Wooden Tray] BIGLUFU wooden tray is made of high-quality paulownia wood, which is lightweight and easy to move. The surface of the wood is painted with a layer of environmentally friendly paint, which can withstand high temperatures, prevent wood corrosion and prolong its service life. The surface is smooth and does not hurt hands, and it is also very easy to clean. 🌟[Multi-Functional Tray] The tray is both practical and decorative. It can be used as a food tray to hold coffee, bread, cakes, and snacks or as storage to place aromatherapy, candles, vases, books, towels, and other items. Due to its excellent corrosion resistance, it can be used in the kitchen, living room, bathroom, bedroom, or picnic. 🌟[Stackable Design] A set of two trays fits perfectly. The large tray measures 15.7 * 11.8 inches, and the small tray measures 13.7 * 9.8 inches, you can stack the two trays together to save space. The side height is 1.3 inches, which can effectively prevent items from falling. 🌟[Durable Iron Handles] The cast iron handles on both sides of the tray are sturdy and durable, and the handle width is suitable for an adult to hold. It's convenient to take the tray out for a picnic or move a full tray around. (simple installation) Please NOTE because our trays are handmade, the size of the screw holes may be a little different. Please use a screwdriver to firmly turn the screws to the end when installing them. 🎁[Exquisite home gift] This bamboo tray is perfect for serving, displaying, decorating, organizing, and storing a variety of items while adding an elegant touch to any place in your home or office. Additionally, it makes an excellent gift for birthdays, holidays, housewarmings, weddings, family, friends, and spa lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sdAkoMq8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIGLUFU","source_asin":"B0B7J342X7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-175702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7J342X7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7J342X7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
